This repository contains two bodies of work.

1. legacy/openerp-7.0/ is a subset (server core and the `account` addon) of OpenERP 7.0,
   copyright OpenERP S.A., published under the GNU Affero General Public License v3
   (AGPL-3). See legacy/openerp-7.0/LICENSE. It is included unmodified as the legacy
   system being modernized.

2. Everything else (the context pack and the modern application under app/) is
   copyright 2026 Tam Tran and is also published under the GNU Affero General Public
   License v3, so the whole repository can be used, studied and shared under one licence.
   The full AGPL-3 text is in legacy/openerp-7.0/LICENSE.
